<Base title="About SalahTimesNow" description="SalahTimesNow gives prayer times, monthly timetables and Qibla bearings for cities in the US, UK and Canada, without an app or sign-up." crumbs={[['About']]}>
  <h1>About SalahTimesNow</h1>
  <p>SalahTimesNow answers one question quickly: when is the next prayer here? Pages load fast, need no app or sign-up, and show the method behind every number, because timetables differ and you should be able to see why.</p>
  <p>We are independent and not a religious authority. Please follow your local mosque's timetable where you have one. Questions or corrections: <a href="/contact/">contact us</a>.</p>
